OL,3,GNEWSAPatient says new kidney programme
OL,4,Achanged his life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with diabetes has said a trial
OL,7,Fprogramme that caught the early signs
OL,8,Fof kidney disease has helped him change
OL,9,Fhis life.
OL,11,FVijay Patel, from Leicester, said the
OL,12,Fscheme's routine blood tests found his
OL,13,Fkidney function was declining, allowing
OL,14,Fhim to change his diet, lifestyle and
OL,15,Fmedication, and delaying the need for
OL,16,Ffurther medical intervention.
OL,18,FThe trial, called LUCID, was pioneered
OL,19,Fin Leicestershire and is now being
OL,20,Frolled out across the UK.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
